 ("ul", ["*He said, \"I can help you.\"* = He said that he could help me.", "*She said, \"You must leave.\"* = She said that I had to leave.", "*He said, \"Shall I help you?\"* = He asked if he should help me.", "*She said, \"I may come.\"* = She said that she might come.", "*The teacher said, \"You should work harder.\"* = The teacher said that I should work harder. (no change)"]),
 ("h2", "Modals in Questions, Requests and Tags"),
 ("ul", ["Questions: invert modal and subject: *Can you swim? Where should I go?*", "Negative questions: *Can't you swim? Shouldn't we leave?*", "Tags: *You can swim, can't you? He must go, mustn't he? You ought to go, oughtn't you? He used to smoke, didn't he? Shall we go? Let's go, shall we?*", "Short answers: *Can you swim? Yes, I can. / No, I can't.*"]),
